!include ../_style.puml

title LINE與QA套件圖
left to right direction

package "web QA channel" as WebQa {
  [qa.routes.js]
  [conversation.routes.js]
}
package "LINE channel" as Line {
  [line.routes.js]
  [lineSignature.middleware.js]
  [line.service.js]
}
package "shared QA application" as SharedQa {
  [qa.service.js]
  [courseAccess.service.js]
  [faqCache.service.js]
  [queryEmbedding.service.js]
  [answerGeneration.service.js]
  [questionRecording.service.js]
}
package "retrieval adapters" as Retrieval {
  [memory retrieval]
  [Atlas Vector Search]
  [guarded hierarchy]
}

WebQa ..> SharedQa : ask / conversation
Line ..> SharedQa : signed event / ask
SharedQa ..> Retrieval : scoped search
SharedQa ..> SharedQa : citation validation / no-answer

note bottom of Retrieval
  hierarchy 為 guarded path；未具備 active contract 與 live E2E 時
  不得宣稱 production ready。
end note

@enduml
